# Separate streaming lifetime from duplicate-locator precedence for…

Separate streaming lifetime from duplicate-locator precedence for
`bm1_bestside`: 18 references face 10 Type-3 `CarStart` candidates, while all
1,100 DynamicZone P3D effects touch none of those mission packages. Camera
best-side lookup is deferred until mission reset; Pure3D starts in its Default
inventory section, searches the current section first, then remaining sections
in creation order. This load path creates Level before Mission. Duplicated
best-side names choose the Level candidate instead of an arbitrary package
winner.

